;. /assess_work_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition assess_work
  ;= Inspect the original native work state
    Bind the raw own-record capture cell. The result retains the exact original record, owner, status and version. This is an as-of assessment. Bind the computed /x output of an existing watching cell to follow changes; a retained snapshot does not establish current availability.

    ;@ /flow/input capture
    ;= capture

    ;@ /flow/step assessment ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/assess_work
    ;@ /flow/bind capture capture
    ;= assessment

    ;@ /flow/result assessment
    ;= Inspect the original native work state result
